{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38600","headline":"古离别 · 吴融","name":"古离别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫鸾黄鹄虽别离，一举千里何难追。\n犹闻啼风与叫月，流连断续令人悲。\n赋情更有深缱绻，碧甃千寻尚爲浅。\n蟾蜍正向清夜流，蛱蝶须教堕丝罥。\n莫道断丝不可续，丹穴凤凰胶不远。\n莫道流水不回波，海上两潮长自返。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}